  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1401\" height=\"151\"></strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>JustAnotherLibraryMod 是幾乎我所有 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/christianbutnot/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組與整合包</a> 的基礎。我製作的所有內容都需要此模組。</li>\n<li>目前它新增了自訂物品類型、工具類型、武器類型，皆可透過將此模組庫作為資源存放庫來存取。</li>\n<li>包含自訂工具等級，例如改良版原版等級（木頭、石頭、鐵、鑽石等）、自訂等級（翡翠、石英、黑曜石），以及更多（主要圍繞我各模組中的自訂工具）</li>\n<li>包含我所有模組的護甲材質，以及更多</li>\n<li>提供多種標籤，可用於所有自訂物品類型</li>\n<li>已實作 Paxel、長矛、刀具、剪刀等多種武器/工具類型，你只需要正確建立它們的物品模型，就能以你希望的方式呈現（可參考 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-some-more-spears\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JustSomeMoreSpears </a>作為範例！）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/christianbutnot/justanotherlibrarymod/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_developers.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1401\" height=\"151\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/VsWATPgvzx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_twitter.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fprogression\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Just_Another_Library/BH_Just_Another_Library_promo2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"251\"></strong></a></p>",
